OL,3,GNEWSACable theft causes 'extensive'
OL,4,Ainternet disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cable theft has caused "extensive"
OL,7,Fdisruption to online services across
OL,8,FBedfordshire.
OL,10,FInfrastructure provider Openreach said
OL,11,Fthe theft was "disrupting local people
OL,12,Fand businesses".
OL,14,FA spokesperson said engineers were
OL,15,Fworking to repair the issue and restore
OL,16,Fservices as soon as possible.
